---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Image from "@/components/Image.astro";
import "@fontsource/poppins/latin-400.css";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <main class="relative min-h-[100svh] flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-[#3E70DF] pt-36 pb-24 sm:pt-44 sm:pb-32">
    <h1 class="mx-auto flex w-[88vw] max-w-[960px] items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-8">
      <span class="font-tiny5 shrink-0 text-[clamp(2.5rem,8vw,6.5rem)] leading-none font-normal text-[#F0EACC]">About</span>
      <Image
        src="/images/logo.svg"
        alt="Sparks!"
        width={402}
        height={192}
        priority
        sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 55vw, 579px"
        class="h-auto min-w-0 w-[55vw] max-w-[579px]"
      />
    </h1>
    <div class="about-copy mx-auto mt-12 w-[88vw] max-w-[960px] space-y-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#F0EACC] sm:mt-16 sm:space-y-9 sm:text-2xl">
      <p>Sparks! is an Indonesian brand created for those of you who sparkle.</p>
      <p>We explore heritage, culture, and traditional textiles, reimagining them in ways that feel fresh, bold, and full of life.</p>
      <p>While the perception of traditional textiles as something formal or old school still lingers, we also see a growing community that appreciates these textiles in everyday life.</p>
      <p>With Sparks!, we aim to create contemporary designs inspired by ikat fabrics, specifically for those of you who are bold, colourful, and brave.</p>
      <p>Dare we say...<br />A spark in the dark?</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-copy {
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
  }
</style>
